      "title": "Inline Table 1",
      "table_type": "inline",
      "html": "<table><tr><td colspan=\"3\">TABLE 6.2 Correlation between Uniting Gametes</td></tr><tr><td>Uniting gametes</td><td>Relative frequency</td><td>Expected values</td></tr><tr><td>A (x = 1)</td><td>$ p^{2} + pqF $</td><td>$ E(x) = p^{2} + pqF + pq - pqF = p^{2} + pq = p(p + q) = p $</td></tr><tr><td>A (x = 1)</td><td>$ pq - pqF $</td><td>$ E(x^{2}) = p^{2} + pqF + pq - pqF = p^{2} + pq = p(p + q) = p $</td></tr><tr><td>a (x = 0)</td><td>$ pq - pqF $</td><td>$ E(y) = p^{2} + pqF + pq - pqF = p^{2} + pq = p(p + q) = p $</td></tr><tr><td>a (x = 0)</td><td>$ q^{2} + pqF $</td><td>$ E(y^{2}) = p^{2} + pqF + pq - pqF = p^{2} + pq = p(p + q) = p $</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td>$ E(xy) = p^{2} + pqF $</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td>Cov(xy) =  $ E(xy) - E(x)E(y) = p^{2} + pqF - p \\times p = pqF $</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td>$ V(x) = E(x^{2}) - [E(x)]^{2} = p - p^{2} = p(1 - p) = pq $</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td>$ V(y) = E(y^{2}) - [E(y)]^{2} = p - p^{2} = p(1 - p) = pq $</td></tr></table>",
      "rows": [
        [
          "TABLE 6.2 Correlation between Uniting Gametes"
        ],
        [
          "Uniting gametes",
          "Relative frequency",
          "Expected values"
        ],
        [
          "A (x = 1)",
          "$ p^{2} + pqF $",
          "$ E(x) = p^{2} + pqF + pq - pqF = p^{2} + pq = p(p + q) = p $"
        ],
        [
          "A (x = 1)",
          "$ pq - pqF $",
          "$ E(x^{2}) = p^{2} + pqF + pq - pqF = p^{2} + pq = p(p + q) = p $"
        ],
        [
          "a (x = 0)",
          "$ pq - pqF $",
          "$ E(y) = p^{2} + pqF + pq - pqF = p^{2} + pq = p(p + q) = p $"
        ],
        [
          "a (x = 0)",
          "$ q^{2} + pqF $",
          "$ E(y^{2}) = p^{2} + pqF + pq - pqF = p^{2} + pq = p(p + q) = p $"
        ],
        [
          "",
          "",
          "$ E(xy) = p^{2} + pqF $"
        ],
        [
          "",
          "",
          "Cov(xy) = $ E(xy) - E(x)E(y) = p^{2} + pqF - p \\times p = pqF $"
        ],
